   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "As we can see, the critical temperature, Tc = 1.05",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Define parameters with arbitrary values *)\r\nα0 = 1.5;\r\nβ = -0.2;\r\nγ = 0.1;\r\nTc = 1; (* Superconducting transition temperature *)\r\n\r\nSol0[T_] := 0\r\n\r\nSol1[T_] := Sqrt[(-β + Sqrt[β^2 - 4*γ*α0*(T - Tc)])/(2*γ)]\r\n\r\nSol2[T_] := -Sqrt[(-β + Sqrt[β^2 - 4*γ*α0*(T - Tc)])/(2*γ)]\r\n\r\nShow[\r\n  Plot[{Sol1[T], Sol2[T]}, {T, 0, 1.5},\r\n    PlotStyle -> {Blue, Blue},\r\n    PlotLegends -> {\"Sol1\", \"Sol2\"},\r\n    Exclusions -> None\r\n  ],\r\n  Plot[Sol0[T], {T, Tc, 1.5},\r\n    PlotStyle -> Red,\r\n    PlotLegends -> {\"Sol0\"},\r\n    Exclusions -> None\r\n  ],\r\n  AxesLabel -> {\"T\", \"m^2\"},\r\n  PlotLabel -> \"m^2 vs T\"\r\n]\r\n\r\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
